  "$a_{{@0}} = a_1\\cdot q^{{@1}} = {@2}\\cdot {@3}^{{@4}} = {@5}\\cdot {@6} = {@7}$.": "$a_{{@0}} = a_1\\cdot q^{{@1}} = {@2}\\cdot {@3}^{{@4}} = {@5}\\cdot {@6} = {@7}$。",
  "$a_{{@0}} = a_1\\cdot q^{{@1}}$ – exponent je ${@2}$, nie ${@3}$.": "$a_{{@0}} = a_1\\cdot q^{{@1}}$：指数は ${@3}$ ではなく ${@2}$ です。",
  "$a_{{@0}} = a_{{@1}}\\cdot q^3$, teda $q^3 = \\frac{{@2}}{{@3}} = {@4}$ a $q = {@5}$. $a_1 = \\frac{a_{{@6}}}{q^{{@7}}} = \\frac{{@8}}{{@9}} = {@10}$.": "$a_{{@0}} = a_{{@1}}\\cdot q^3$ なので、$q^3 = \\frac{{@2}}{{@3}} = {@4}$、$q = {@5}$ です。$a_1 = \\frac{a_{{@6}}}{q^{{@7}}} = \\frac{{@8}}{{@9}} = {@10}$。",
  "$f(0) = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\neq 0$, preto nie je nepárna; $f\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) = 1$, ale $f\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) = 0$, preto nie je párna.": "$f(0) = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\neq 0$ なので奇関数ではありません。$f\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) = 1$ ですが $f\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) = 0$ なので偶関数でもありません。",
  "$f(\\pi) = \\pi - 1$, ale $f(-\\pi) = -\\pi - 1$, čo sa nerovná ani $\\pi - 1$, ani $-(\\pi - 1)$.": "$f(\\pi) = \\pi - 1$ ですが、$f(-\\pi) = -\\pi - 1$ で、これは $\\pi - 1$ とも $-(\\pi - 1)$ とも等しくありません。",
  "$f\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) = 2$, ale $f\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) = 0$, čo sa nerovná ani $2$, ani $-2$.": "$f\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) = 2$ ですが、$f\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) = 0$ で、これは $2$ とも $-2$ とも等しくありません。",
  "$f\\left({@0}\\right) = {@1}{@2}\\cdot {@3}\\,{@4} = {@5}\\cdot {@6} = {@7}$.": "$f\\left({@0}\\right) = {@1}{@2}\\cdot {@3}\\,{@4} = {@5}\\cdot {@6} = {@7}$。",
  "$k = \\frac{y_B - y_A}{x_B - x_A} = \\frac{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$. Z bodu $A$: $q = y_A - k x_A = {@3} - {@4}\\cdot {@5} = {@6}$. Priamka: ${@7}$.": "$k = \\frac{y_B - y_A}{x_B - x_A} = \\frac{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$。点 $A$ から：$q = y_A - k x_A = {@3} - {@4}\\cdot {@5} = {@6}$。直線：${@7}$。",
  "$q = 1 + \\frac{{@0}}{1200} \\approx {@1}$, $n = {@2}$. $a = D\\cdot\\frac{q^n(q - 1)}{q^n - 1} = {@3}\\cdot\\frac{q^{{@4}}(q - 1)}{q^{{@5}} - 1} \\approx {@6}$ €.": "$q = 1 + \\frac{{@0}}{1200} \\approx {@1}$、$n = {@2}$。$a = D\\cdot\\frac{q^n(q - 1)}{q^n - 1} = {@3}\\cdot\\frac{q^{{@4}}(q - 1)}{q^{{@5}} - 1} \\approx {@6}$ ユーロ。",
  "$q = 1 + \\frac{{@0}}{1200}$, $n = {@1}$, splátka $a = {@2}\\cdot\\frac{q^{{@3}}(q - 1)}{q^{{@4}} - 1} \\approx {@5}$ €. Spolu zaplatíme ${@6}\\cdot {@7} = {@8}$ €, preplatok je ${@9} - {@10} = {@11}$ €.": "$q = 1 + \\frac{{@0}}{1200}$、$n = {@1}$、返済額 $a = {@2}\\cdot\\frac{q^{{@3}}(q - 1)}{q^{{@4}} - 1} \\approx {@5}$ ユーロ。合計の支払いは ${@6}\\cdot {@7} = {@8}$ ユーロで、払いすぎた額は ${@9} - {@10} = {@11}$ ユーロです。",
  "$q = {@0}$. {@1}$S_{{@2}} = {@3}{@4}\\cdot\\frac{{@5}^{{@6}} - 1}{{@7} - 1} \\approx {@8}$ €.": "$q = {@0}$。{@1}$S_{{@2}} = {@3}{@4}\\cdot\\frac{{@5}^{{@6}} - 1}{{@7} - 1} \\approx {@8}$ ユーロ。",
  "$s_{{@0}} = a_1\\cdot\\frac{q^{{@1}} - 1}{q - 1} = {@2}\\cdot\\frac{{@3} - 1}{{@4} - 1} = {@5}$.": "$s_{{@0}} = a_1\\cdot\\frac{q^{{@1}} - 1}{q - 1} = {@2}\\cdot\\frac{{@3} - 1}{{@4} - 1} = {@5}$。",
  "$x = {@0} + 2k\\pi$ alebo $x = {@1} + 2k\\pi$": "$x = {@0} + 2k\\pi$ または $x = {@1} + 2k\\pi$",
  "${@0} = ({@1}\\cdot {@2} {@3} {@4}\\cdot {@5}; {@6}\\cdot {@7} {@8} {@9}\\cdot {@10}) = {@11}$.": "${@0} = ({@1}\\cdot {@2} {@3} {@4}\\cdot {@5}; {@6}\\cdot {@7} {@8} {@9}\\cdot {@10}) = {@11}$。",
  "${@0} = {@1}$ (pozor, $0! = 1$).": "${@0} = {@1}$（注意：$0! = 1$）。",
  "${@0} = {@1}$ pre $x \\in \\{{@2}\\}$.": "$x \\in \\{{@2}\\}$ のとき ${@0} = {@1}$。",
  "${@0} = {@1}$, teda ${@2}$. Korene sú ${@3}$ a ${@4}$; prirodzené je len $n = {@5}$.": "${@0} = {@1}$ なので、${@2}$。解は ${@3}$ と ${@4}$ で、自然数は $n = {@5}$ だけです。",
  "${@0}^\\circ = {@1}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{180} = \\frac{{@2}}{180}\\pi = {@3}$, teda $k = {@4}$.": "${@0}^\\circ = {@1}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{180} = \\frac{{@2}}{180}\\pi = {@3}$ なので、$k = {@4}$ です。",
  "$|AB| = \\sqrt{({@0} - {@1})^2 + ({@2} - {@3})^2} = \\sqrt{{@4} + {@5}} = \\sqrt{{@6}}{@7}$.": "$|AB| = \\sqrt{({@0} - {@1})^2 + ({@2} - {@3})^2} = \\sqrt{{@4} + {@5}} = \\sqrt{{@6}}{@7}$。",
  "$|\\Omega| = 6\\cdot 6 = 36$. Priaznivých výsledkov je {@0}{@1}. $P = \\frac{{@2}}{36}{@3}$.": "$|\\Omega| = 6\\cdot 6 = 36$。条件に合う結果は {@0} 通り{@1}です。$P = \\frac{{@2}}{36}{@3}$。",
  "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{32}{2} = {@0}$. Priaznivých výberov je {@1}. $P = \\frac{{@2}}{{@3}} = {@4}$.": "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{32}{2} = {@0}$。条件に合う選び方は {@1} 通りです。$P = \\frac{{@2}}{{@3}} = {@4}$。",
  "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{2} = {@1}$. Priaznivých dvojíc je {@2}. $P = \\frac{{@3}}{{@4}}{@5}$.": "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{2} = {@1}$。条件に合う組は {@2} 通りです。$P = \\frac{{@3}}{{@4}}{@5}$。",
  "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$. Priaznivé: vyberieme {@3} z {@4} červených a {@5} z {@6} bielych: $\\binom{{@7}}{{@8}}\\cdot\\binom{{@9}}{{@10}} = {@11}\\cdot {@12} = {@13}$. $P = \\frac{{@14}}{{@15}}{@16}$.": "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$。条件に合うもの：赤 {@4} 個から {@3} 個、白 {@6} 個から {@5} 個を選びます：$\\binom{{@7}}{{@8}}\\cdot\\binom{{@9}}{{@10}} = {@11}\\cdot {@12} = {@13}$。$P = \\frac{{@14}}{{@15}}{@16}$。",
  "$|\\sin(-x)| = |-\\sin x| = |\\sin x|$.": "$|\\sin(-x)| = |-\\sin x| = |\\sin x|$。",
  "(na dve desatinné miesta)": "（小数第 2 位まで）",
  "(vieš, že $a_{{@0}} = {@1}$)": "（$a_{{@0}} = {@1}$ であることはわかっています）",
